			"Message": "chore(Maintain/Build): Add compiled build tools for debug and release configurations\n\nAdded newly built executables for the Maintain component's build tooling in both debug and release configurations. These executables (`Build.exe` and `Maintain.exe`) are generated from the Rust source code in the `Element/Maintain` submodule and support the project's infrastructure operations.\n\nAs part of the Land project's build system, these tools handle:\n1. GritQL transformations for code migrations\n2. CI/CD pipeline automation\n3. Project maintenance scripts\n\nThe inclusion of both debug (larger, unoptimized) and release (optimized) binaries allows developers to choose the appropriate version for their workflow while ensuring consistent build tooling across environments. This supports the project's infrastructure-as-code approach within the final architecture.",
